<title>UK: SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND, SECOND LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP FIRST PRELIMINARY ROUND, SECOND LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of UEFA Cup first</p>
<p>preliminary round, second leg matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Budapest: Ferencvaros (Hungary) 5 Bohemians Dublin</p>
<p>(Ireland) 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Florian Albert 15, Zoltan Jagodics 47, 74, Levente</p>
<p>Schultz 58, Gabor Zavadszky 71</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,170.</p>
<p>Ferencvaros win 6-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Glasgow: Celtic (Scotland) 5 Inter Cable-Tel Cardiff</p>
<p>(Wales) 0 (3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Andreas Thom 19 pen, Darren Jackson 42, Tommy</p>
<p>Johnson 45, David Hannah 63, Chris Hay 85</p>
<p>Attendance:41,537</p>
<p>Celtic win 8-0 on aggregate</p>
